# 3Lens Project Standards

**Full principles and architecture: [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md)**

This rule defers to AGENTS.md for:
- Non-negotiable design principles (shared primitives, inspector spine, attribution, fidelity, etc.)
- Architecture layers and dependency rules
- Definition of Done

## Quick Reminders

- Kernel: ZERO imports from UI/Mount
- Metrics must have attribution paths
- Fidelity: EXACT | ESTIMATED | UNAVAILABLE
- Live and offline parity required

